# TreeTagger Indonesian tagset
#
# Indonesian TreeTagger Part-of-Speech Tags, following the Indonesian tagset of
# Dinakaramani et al. (2014). Each tag is a single atomic label (no morphological
# features). WH (question word) conflates interrogative pronouns and adverbs and
# is mapped to POS_PRON; MD (modal/auxiliary verb) to POS_AUX; NND (classifier/
# measurement noun) to POS_NOUN; NEG and RP (particles) to POS_PART; Z and SENT
# (punctuation) to POS_PUNCT.
#
# Source: extracted from the TreeTagger model using TT4J
__META_SOURCE_URL__=https\://www.sketchengine.eu/indonesian-treetagger-tagset/
__META_TYPE_BASE__=de.tudarmstadt.ukp.dkpro.core.api.lexmorph.type.pos.

CC=POS_CONJ
CD=POS_NUM
DT=POS_DET
FW=POS_X
IN=POS_ADP
JJ=POS_ADJ
MD=POS_AUX
NEG=POS_PART
NN=POS_NOUN
NND=POS_NOUN
NNP=POS_PROPN
OD=POS_NUM
PR=POS_PRON
PRP=POS_PRON
RB=POS_ADV
RP=POS_PART
SC=POS_SCONJ
SENT=POS_PUNCT
SYM=POS_SYM
UH=POS_INTJ
VB=POS_VERB
WH=POS_PRON
X=POS_X
Z=POS_PUNCT
fw=POS_X

# Catch-all rule
*=POS
